{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/9dnc80fbv5z1et5tahvp7ixl2lxxo9g.mp3","text":"您好，博士......请多关照。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/ihgm4ivti6dk5gq35p5zpxbj65ncrp1.mp3","text":"那个......抱歉......我不太擅长，与人交谈......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/q3wloya1ryp0u8r6dlyrl49tvtt0i1h.mp3","text":"是的......我的双亲是维多利亚的商人。但是我很长时间没能和他们联络上了......这个代号，能让我想起自己的家......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/02cr9f09d2x7sk45t4vg9ktiqjjwx5s.mp3","text":"那、那位戴着面具的干员......让我感到......有些不安......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/k0vclgrk4zrwiboem3a886optl9s0f5.mp3","text":"不，我并不是......不想接近大家，只是，我不知道......该怎么做才好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/4m41eu2g8rsyx5hqoz6xi2um4bonqsv.mp3","text":"对不起，安赛尔......我又让你担心了。不过，不用这样关照我，还有更多需要帮助的人在等着你呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/6s7r94s3qbwnf9steialyai6j28n66k.mp3","text":"矿石病，曾经让我拥有过强大的感知能力，而这份能力正在不断地消逝......但是，就算是这样，我也不会退缩的......我还想，和大家多说说话......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/2tig7e80s1lomiazsl93znbjzptzgfp.mp3","text":"博士，您，能收下这瓶香水吗？这是我从家里带出来的......这种香水，有振奋精神的功效，在我没有精神的时候，我就会闻一闻它......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/s92nbp53di5iwumqrlpprrbffrz74ci.mp3","text":"梅莉？别太吵闹......博士已经很累了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/rgs680t160rao80var3aksder9ivxfc.mp3","text":"......玫兰莎。从现在起，我的利刃将为您所用。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/gyophppj8d8u1v25ei07ukuiidehy3n.mp3","text":"谢谢您的指导......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/7y1or6jxzlnxbj3sejg2j0zb7b0zbly.mp3","text":"非常感谢您......那个，其他人也获得晋升了吗？我想，大家应该都和我一样，拥有这样的资格。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/3pmcdgygbgxacipqx06kj4s8k3u2mw9.mp3","text":"嗯......我会遵照您的指示行动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/1o9gv59aav7mofhjihwgh4gw7l53mnr.mp3","text":"我......吗？我，不擅长指挥他人......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/5k7xj42epihhjuxt3aa4y194c69tgk8.mp3","text":"各位，为这个世界，带来更多和平吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/reqhorrvxureqqli7vy9pmbqwulzkm4.mp3","text":"安赛尔......接下来，就拜托你了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/s4g99h3k4sl8foduaqerxe97t4sblsg.mp3","text":"请指示......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/lvejx2utg1r36mopz4og9nid52s1g7s.mp3","text":"命令是......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/3aked9fisvufsigyu4afnwfaokelzkg.mp3","text":"了解了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/rkf9dd6y2uvr3lc0svs4q0xjlp2zuux.mp3","text":"尽我所能。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/ahtf2lz61afge2k0i6oae30ylws5vr1.mp3","text":"打倒你......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/0awuptqa2wgi6t6qn7doic6dlkfylo0.mp3","text":"斩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/jxxjysnqpv13uld37we3du81u75xlnd.mp3","text":"无论什么样的困难，都无法阻止我前进。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/dnc4dsh479i38ilgo1eb89i7r6v4ufk.mp3","text":"赢了吗？太好了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/qeeuw81vg00c33aquxswp8pslasovsz.mp3","text":"我还能继续战斗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/pxjzd2s99pt8mranwu718et4iexr0m5.mp3","text":"失败了......竟然，会变成这样......","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/n1npdz2zr5eh2ei0v0raovq5bmighym.mp3","text":"这里......这里还有其他人在的吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/0ziyr2y57gb60m6iz3enarrgj0tjh6s.mp3","text":"是、是谁——博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/ey3fwjce59favos1ommt5c54esgpk6n.mp3","text":"博士，感谢您一直这样关心我......那个，其实......我希望自己，今后也能更多地去战斗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/5dm8h3w4mp71a5tbnq9zauehs41mqc8.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/d2kcb34rp5qzs5cs00temwgnd0runfk.mp3","text":"新年......快乐，博士，我的父母也给我寄来了信件和礼物，我的感知能力在今天似乎也有所好转，今天......是很开心的一天，希望您也有这样的好心情。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/r7crij9ysdfm5l37fe5yn60h4hr42xl.mp3","text":"博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_208_melan/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/q75xlzvjsyhivzmq1mfnxufqlebq2fv.mp3","text":"您好，博士......请多关照。","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/6r37h8dp4v5k4qxet94x2jn5gtn47ry.mp3","text":"那个......抱歉......我不太擅长，与人交谈......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/9zzidumlpc14cugjfukttrh97cnjl9n.mp3","text":"是的......我的双亲是维多利亚的商人。但是我很长时间没能和他们联络上了......这个代号，能让我想起自己的家......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/ovwhzyg97a88csfnktqmtkohmtts3u5.mp3","text":"那、那位戴着面具的干员......让我感到......有些不安......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/9yrh1h0xcetv2b54xdohl2cm7e6p72u.mp3","text":"不，我并不是......不想接近大家，只是，我不知道......该怎么做才好......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/pxpfqhtz29v56d0spffht3iqjg55ueq.mp3","text":"对不起，安赛尔......我又让你担心了。不过，不用这样关照我，还有更多需要帮助的人在等着你呢。","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/tepm4u88xr1c9fikuhhwykk3f47x80q.mp3","text":"矿石病，曾经让我拥有过强大的感知能力，而这份能力正在不断地消逝......但是，就算是这样，我也不会退缩的......我还想，和大家多说说话......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/3ndkntwmhv3b6o07tw43vp62nfg12nc.mp3","text":"博士，您，能收下这瓶香水吗？这是我从家里带出来的......这种香水，有振奋精神的功效，在我没有精神的时候，我就会闻一闻它......","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/92hrqk2g20a80yexqrgz99dp1qdnwrd.mp3","text":"梅莉？别太吵闹......博士已经很累了。","alt":"voice/char_208_melan/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/9s4y083mi